                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \pi_n(X_s) \to \pi_n(Y_s) \to \pi_{n-1}(X_{s+1}) \to \pi_{n-1}(Y_{s+1}) \to \pi_{n-2}(X_{s+2})
          %p
            the middle two maps are adjacent in a LES, hence compose to
