                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} H_{n,s}(\pi_\ast(X_\ast))
            ”, we can lift it to
            = succeed "," do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
