                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} H_{n,s}(\pi_\ast(X_\ast))
            into another chain complex, and that elements of its homology can be lifted to
            = succeed "." do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
