            page. (There are fancier sorts of convergence that apply to more general situations, but I don’t want to get into that right now.) One writes this as
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
